{"id":"granicus-1-518","platform":"granicus","body":"City Council","name":"Equestrian Committee Meeting","date":"2021-02-22","time":"","canceled":false,"agenda_url":"https://rollinghillsestatesca.granicus.com/AgendaViewer.php?view_id=1&clip_id=518","minutes_url":"https://rollinghillsestatesca.granicus.com/MinutesViewer.php?view_id=1&clip_id=518&doc_id=4cf143de-9d3f-11eb-8549-0050569183fa","packet_url":"","clip_id":518,"view_id":1,"video_url":"https://rollinghillsestatesca.granicus.com/MediaPlayer.php?view_id=1&clip_id=518","transcript_url":"","mp4_url":"","mp3_url":"","agenda_text":"CITY OF\n\n  ROLLING HILLS ESTATES\n  4045 PALOS VERDES DRIVE NORTH • ROLLING HILLS ESTATES, CA 90274\n  TELEPHONE 310.377.1577 • FAX 310.377.4468\n  www.RollingHillsEstatesCa.gov\n\n  Regular Meeting Agenda\n  EQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE\n\nMonday, February 22, 2021  7:00 PM  Teleconference\n\nPursuant to the Governor's Executive Order N-29-20, Equestrian Committee Members will be participating via\nteleconference.\n\n- Members of the public may listen to the meeting live by calling: (1-669-900-6833) from any phone, Meeting ID:\n936 5310 9416, Meeting Password: 781629. (Please note you will not have the ability to speak using the call-in\noption from a phone line.)\n\n- Public correspondence may be emailed to Cynthia Morquecho, Community Services Supervisor at\ncynthiam@rollinghillsestatesca.gov. Emails received before 5:00 p.m. the night of the meeting will be forwarded\nto the Committee Members for their consideration and included as part of the record.\n\n- Members of the public may comment online using eComment on the “Meeting Agendas, Minutes & Videos”\npage of the City’s website (www.rhe.city/agendas). Once the agenda is published, there will be an “eComment”\nbutton next to the linked agenda under \"Upcoming Events\". Follow this link to the City’s SpeakUp page. After\nyou register, you may comment on any item on that particular agenda. These comments can be seen by the\npublic, will be considered by the Committee and become part of the record.\n\n- Members of the public who wish to speak during this meeting may join the Zoom meeting by accessing the\nZoom app from a computer (downloaded at Zoom.com) or tablet or phone (downloaded in the App Store), by\nentering the following credentials: Meeting ID: 936 5310 9416, Meeting Password: 781629. Members of the public\nwho join the Zoom meeting will not have video, and may request to speak using the following process: After\njoining the Zoom meeting, if you wish to speak, please select the \"raise hand\" option at the lower portion of your\nscreen. The Meeting Host will send you a chat message to identify which item on the agenda you would like to\nspeak on and will unmute your mic at the appropriate time.\n\nAgenda reports and other disclosable public records relating to each agenda item are available on the City's\nwebsite under Meeting Agendas, Minutes & Videos at www.rhe.city/agendas.\n\nEQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE  Page 1\n2/22/2021\nAmericans With Disabilities Act: In compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act, if you require a disability-related\nmodification or accommodation to attend or participate in this meeting, including auxiliary aids or services, please call the\nCity Clerk's office at (310) 377-1577 at least 48 hours prior to the meeting.\n\fEquestrian Committee  Regular Meeting Agenda  February 22, 2021\n\n1.  CALL TO ORDER\n\n2.  INTRODUCTION OF CHAIR AND NEW COMMITTEE MEMBERS\n\n3.  ROLL CALL\n\n4.  APPROVAL OF MINUTES\n\n  A.  EQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE MEETING MINUTES OF JANUARY 25, 2021\n\n  Attachments: Draft Minutes\n\n5.  AUDIENCE ITEMS WRITTEN /ORAL COMMUNICATIONS NOT ON AGENDA\n\n6.  DISCUSSION ITEMS\n\n7.  STAFF ITEMS\n\n  A.  COVID-19 UPDATE (VERBAL REPORT)\n\n  B.  PETER WEBER  EQUESTRIAN  CENTER  SURVEY  UPDATE  (VERBAL\n  REPORT)\n  C.  CAPITAL IMPROVEMENT PROJECT LIST\n\n  Attachments: Staff Report\n\n  D.  EQUESTRIAN ISSUES LOG\n\n  Attachments: Equestrian Issues Log\n\n8.  COMMITTEE REPORTS\n\n  A.  ADOPT-A-TRAIL (VERBAL REPORT)\n\n9.  FUTURE AGENDA ITEMS\n\n  A.  YOUTH AMBASSADOR PROGRAM\n\n10.  ADJOURNMENT\n  The next Equestrian Committee meeting will be held on Monday, March 22, 2021 at 7:00 p.m.\n\nEQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE  Page 2\n2/22/2021\nAmericans With Disabilities Act: In compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act, if you require a disability-related\nmodification or accommodation to attend or participate in this meeting, including auxiliary aids or services, please call the\nCity Clerk's office at (310) 377-1577 at least 48 hours prior to the meeting.","minutes_text":"PK\u0003\u0004\u0014\u0000\u0006\u0000\b\u0000\u0000\u0000!\u0000v��z�\u0001\u0000\u0000�\u0007\u0000\u0000\u0013\u0000\b\u0002[Content_Types].xml �\u0004\u0002(�\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u